data: {"id": "82b2da4eddaf404b-thinking-parallel_evidence-782", "run_id": "82b2da4eddaf404b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 首轮可观测性结果综述（已预采集）\n\n根据已有工具结果，先确认以下基线事实：\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 关键事实 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| **Metrics** | present | `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)`, `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ContainerCreating(1)`, `restarts=0` — Pod 仍处在 Pending/ContainerCreating，未启动 |\n| **Logging** | empty | Elasticsearch 无该 Pod 日志（容器未启动，预期为空） |\n| **Tracing** | empty | DeepFlow 因 `pod_ip is empty` 无法查询，Tempo 无 trace_id — 沙箱未建成，预期为空 |\n| **Topology** | 未执行 | 待通过 `query_pod_topology` 获取 owner/node/owner 关系 |\n\n当前 Me", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788783908545, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

